Defining Properties of a Dialog Item
Plant Simulation Help 11-5067
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Name [dialog item in Dialog]
Type in the Name of the dialog item. The Dialog shows this Name in the text box on the tab Elements.
Remarks
You can type in the same Name for dialog items, as long as those dialog items are not located in the same
group of items. Groups of items are: Group Box, Menu, Tab Control and Tab.
We recommend to type in a unique identifier, containing the type of dialog item, for example
xyz_button, xyz_list, etc.
Note
You cannot use a period (.) in the name of a dialog item. As SimTalk treats this name as a string, you
can also type in special characters.
A Method object can call this dialog item using the Name you typed in. For some dialog items you can type
in a Caption in addition.
