Enable [check box] - dialog item
Select this check box to Enable the respective dialog item. Clear the check box to not enable it.
Remarks
For a dialog item of Type > New Button, New Check Box, New Radio Button, New Edit Text Box, New
List Box, and New List View the Dialog shows the check box Enable.
You can:
• Select Enable to activate the respective dialog item, 
  for example, in the Dialog. When the user
selects it, it triggers the Callback Method, which executes the actions you programmed.
• Clear it to deactivate the dialog item, i.e., to gray it out 
  in the Dialog, and thus make it not
available to the user.
